<%- include('../partials/page-hero', {
  heading: 'Privacy Notice',
  intro: 'How information submitted through wetomtech.com is handled.'
}) %>
<section class="section legal-section">
  <div class="container legal-content">
    <h2>Information collected</h2>
    <p>The website collects the contact and project information voluntarily entered into contact, coverage, quotation and career forms.</p>
    <h2>Purpose of collection</h2>
    <p>Information is used to respond to enquiries, assess service requests, prepare follow-up communication and manage expressions of interest.</p>
    <h2>Storage and access</h2>
    <p>Submitted information should be accessible only to authorised WetomTech personnel and service providers involved in operating the website or responding to the request.</p>
    <h2>Data minimisation</h2>
    <p>Do not submit passwords, banking credentials, national identification numbers or other unnecessary sensitive information through the website forms.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about website information may be sent to <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
